    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## MASEO web app + API\nThe backend of the MASEO web app (webapp/app.py, FastAPI, port 8080): it calls only the webhooks below, and each passes the call to the MASEO atomic service (`http://maseo:8030`), which keeps the job queue. Queued jobs are run one at a time by the workflow **MASEO worker (agent_graph)**.\n\nSuccessful executions of this workflow are not saved (a page showing a running job reloads every few seconds).",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "66674f03-c6b6-5ad1-ad4b-c8b88e51514a",
      "name": "Note: web app",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -300
      ]
    }
